<div><p><span>Rings are a fashion accessory that most people love to highlight themselves, but you want to buy a ring to surprise your girlfriend but don&#x27;t know how to choose the ring size? Below <strong>Helios<span> </span></strong>will guide you through some ways to choose <span><strong><a href="https://helios.vn/blogs/nhan/size-nhan-nu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">women&#x27;s ring sizes</a></strong></span> so you can choose the most suitable and beautiful ring to give them!</span></p>

<h2> <b>Popular women&#x27;s ring size chart that guys should know</b>
</h2>

 <p><span>What ring size do women usually wear? How to choose the right size for women? These are common questions when guys choose a ring for their girlfriend. To determine the ring size for women, men need to rely on <strong>the women&#x27;s ring size chart</strong> . Currently, each store will have a different women&#x27;s size chart. Refer to the <span><a href="https://helios.vn/collections/nhan-bac-nam" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>silver ring</strong></a></span> size chart at Helios:</span> </p>

<p><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0644/2958/8701/files/size_nhan_480x480.png?v=1720601865" alt="Women&#x27;s ring size chart" loading="lazy" width="400" height="480"></p>

<p> <span>If you know <strong>the female ring size</strong> or the female ring size of the person you want to give a gift to, you can not only choose a ring that fits her finger, but you can also find a meaningful ring that is suitable to give her!</span></p>

 <h2><b>Some ways to measure women&#x27;s ring size</b></h2>

<p> Next, Helios introduces you to some ways and tips to help you estimate to choose <strong>women&#x27;s ring size</strong> based on wrist diameter, hand size measurement or estimate by height and weight.</p>

<p> We will suggest you some tips to choose the right ring size for your girlfriend&#x27;s finger, please refer to:</p>

<h3> <b>Measure the ring she is wearing</b>
</h3>

<p> The first simple way to know your girlfriend&#x27;s ring size without detecting is to pretend to borrow the ring she is wearing. Then find a place where she doesn&#x27;t know and use a ruler to measure the circumference of the ring inside in mm, through which you will get her exact <strong>female ring</strong> size.</p>

 <div><a href="https://helios.vn/products/nhan-bac-s925-bani-lotus-ring-en-helios-silver-original" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0644/2958/8701/files/DSC08675_20cb3bc5-e16b-4718-9fda-9d9ab058d723_480x480.jpg?v=1683973840" alt="BANI LOTUS RING Helios Silver black stone - How to choose the size of a female ring for your girlfriend" loading="lazy" width="384" height="480"></a></div>

<h3> <b>Feel and compare her hand with your own.</b>
</h3>

<p> <span>First you need to determine the size of your finger based on <span><strong><a href="https://helios.vn/blogs/nhan/size-nhan-nam" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the men&#x27;s ring size</a></strong> chart.</span> Then feel and compare your hand with your girlfriend&#x27;s to know the ring size. While holding your girlfriend&#x27;s hand, try to put your two fingers close together and measure the difference between her finger and yours. At this point, you will surely know the approximate <strong>size of a woman&#x27;s ring</strong> .</span></p>

<div> <a href="https://helios.vn/collections/nhan-doi/products/nhan-bac-nam-nu-helisilver-astina-ring-helios-original-s925" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0644/2958/8701/files/DSC02071_2_480x480.jpg?v=1683973905" alt="Astina Ring Helios Silver - How to choose ring size for girlfriend" loading="lazy" width="384" height="480"></a>
</div>

 <h3><b>Choose ring size according to her weight</b></h3>

<p> <span>In case you do not want to measure <strong>the female ring size</strong> by the above methods, you can measure the ring size according to her weight and height to choose the corresponding ring size from the ring, middle and index fingers as follows:</span> </p>

<ul>

<li>

<span></span><span> </span><span>Female 150cm tall, 40kg weight suitable for ring size 7, 9, 10.</span> 

</li>

<li>

<span></span><span> </span><span>Female 150cm tall, 45kg weight suitable for ring size 8, 10, 11.</span> 

</li>

<li>

<span></span><span> </span><span>Female 155cm tall, 45kg weight suitable for ring size 9, 11, 12.</span>

</li>

<li> 
<span></span><span> </span><span>Female 160cm tall, 50kg weight suitable for ring size 11, 13, 14.</span> 

</li>

<li>

<span></span><span> </span><span>Female 165cm tall, 60kg weight suitable for ring size 13, 15, 17.</span> 

</li>

<li>

<span></span><span> </span><span>Female 170cm tall, 65kg weight suitable for ring size 14, 16, 17.</span>

</li>


</ul>

