<h3> <b>How to measure women&#x27;s ring size with tape measure</b>
</h3>

 <p><span>To measure the ring size so that your girlfriend does not suspect, you can do it when she is sleeping soundly. The man needs to have a tape measure ready by fixing the 0 position of the tape measure on the finger that you want to buy the girl&#x27;s ring and wrap it around so that it fits snugly. Then, based on the measurement, compare it with <strong>the women&#x27;s ring size chart</strong> to get the result.</span></p>

