<h3> <b>Thanks to the common relationship</b>
</h3>

 <p><span>This is the simplest way for a man to know his girlfriend&#x27;s ring size, which is to ask for help from her relatives such as her mother, sister or close friend to easily get information about <strong>her female ring size</strong> .</span></p>

